{"id":"We9ee8a5e596c8d9b9a27bfa6","zh":"概率模型","en":"","name":"概率模型","language":"zh","domain":"车辆—轨道与基础结构动力学","concept_id":null,"families":[],"definition_zh":null,"definition_en":null,"scope_note":null,"usage_note":null,"usage_overview":null,"translation_note":null,"usage_variants":[],"designations":[{"id":"We9ee8a5e596c8d9b9a27bfa6","text":"概率模型","language":"zh","role":"headword"}],"complete_examples":[{"id":"S7589b577958dd9a29244","source_id":"P115","page":3,"page_end":3,"language":"zh","text":"Xu等提出的轨道不平顺概率模型(Track Irregularity Probabilistic Model,TIPM)[3,10]已被引入轨道不平顺敏感性分析 [11]、概率关系 [12]、地震 [13]、可靠性分析 [14-16]等研究领域。","citations":[{"source_id":"P115","page":3,"page_end":3}]},{"id":"Sc279b0db4f631f2cc8fc","source_id":"P115","page":3,"page_end":3,"language":"zh","text":"鉴于此,本文进一步以轨道不平顺实测数据和车辆-轨道耦合动力学为基础,从轨道不平顺及其激扰下的系统动力响应概率分布出发,对比分析轨道不平顺概率模型与轨道不平顺随机模型的计算结果,以进一步验证轨道不平顺概率模型的可靠性和高效性,为轨道不平顺随机模拟方法和车辆-轨道系统随机分析、可靠度评估提供可行的技术手段。","citations":[{"source_id":"P115","page":3,"page_end":3}]},{"id":"S9e89aa2e9ee21892f745","source_id":"P131","page":5,"page_end":5,"language":"zh","text":"轨道不平顺概率模型较好解决了车辆-轨道系统不平顺激励源的概率求解问题,由于此系统除轨道不平顺外不存在其他的随机激扰源,可认为不平顺激励与系统动力响应之间按等概率传递。","citations":[{"source_id":"P131","page":5,"page_end":5}]},{"id":"S68b9a517277a3d7b8158","source_id":"P131","page":8,"page_end":8,"language":"zh","text":"本文引入的轨道不平顺概率模型为可靠度计算中的关键问题(即随机变量的概率分布函数)提供了良好途径。","citations":[{"source_id":"P131","page":8,"page_end":8}]}],"sources":{"P003":{"id":"P003","title":"A probabilistic model for track random irregularities in vehicle/track coupled dynamics","authors":"L Xu, W Zhai, J Gao","year":"2017","doi":"10.1016/j.apm.2017.06.027","journal_citation":"Applied Mathematical Modelling 51, 145-158","label":"Xu等（2017）","overview_slug":"xu-2017-track-irregularity"},"P115":{"id":"P115","title":"轨道不平顺概率模型","authors":"徐磊,翟婉明","year":"2018","doi":"10.19818/j.cnki.1671-1637.2018.03.006","journal_citation":"交通运输工程学报","label":"徐磊等（2018）","overview_slug":"2018-track-irregularity-probabilistic-mode